This package enables only compact BF16 semantic/EOS output projection. Model
weights, sampling, default public-domain LJ Speech voice, original BF16 codec,
LAN/origin/body/consent/admission validation and original WAV API are retained.
Optional kernel, quantization, smaller-bucket, prefix and per-frame streaming
experiments are not admitted. A source file may contain an unused prototype;
its presence is not supported or validated capability.
